Vulnerable place 1: `wp-admin/post.php`
`$newmeta['thumb']` is placed into DB not sanitized directly from user input.
```
case 'editattachment':
    check_admin_referer('update-post_' . $post_id);
    // Don't let these be changed
    unset($_POST['guid']);
    $_POST['post_type'] = 'attachment';
